  "body": "According to CSP, the interface for the `securitypolicyviolation` event is `SecurityPolicyViolationEvent`, not `Event` https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#report-violation\n\nhttps://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/content-security-policy/navigation/to-javascript-url-script-src.html and https://wpt.fyi/results/content-security-policy/navigation/to-javascript-url-script-src.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned illustrates that's indeed what's implemented (at least in Chromium & Webkit)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8062/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2022, 8:12 AM UTC (76d8519)\">/indices.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8062/6682bde...76d8519/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2022, 8:12 AM UTC (76d8519)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8062/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2022, 8:12 AM UTC (76d8519)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8062/6682bde...76d8519/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 1, 2022, 8:12 AM UTC (76d8519)\">diff</a> )",
